      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:g2wv2q'
    '|a||Вот Каза́нь.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 1480
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:15ajd7w'
    '|a||Дере́вня недалеко́, к ю́гу от Каза́ни.':
